    "execution": "Hash-pinned selected original functions in a host at 0x3f0000. Frontend 0x42bac0, origin helper 0x4423a0, backend 0x42c700, lighting 0x43dba0 and normalization 0x4135d0, beam 0x442450 and original math helpers, beam queue 0x4425e0, model registration 0x43c810. Renderer/GL callbacks, world-light trace and inline-index parsing are recording stubs. No original entry point or graphics/input/audio/network startup.",
